    "name": "Linux Security Audit API - Updated",
    "description": "Updated for current internal/api router and service DTOs. Run Admin Login first; set credentials locally. Create policy before assigning policy_id to a host. Host policy_id is optional on POST and supports integer/null on PATCH. Rule JSON field is type (not rule_type). Snapshot import needs real collector v2 JSON. Destructive requests run last. Tokens are not embedded.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
